    "text": "Even if the peace talks this weekend between the U.S. and Iran result in a deal to end the war, the impact on the global energy economy will persist due to uncertainty in the Strait of Hormuz. Chevron's CEO Mike Wirth expressed concern not only about mines in the Strait of Hormuz",
