    "text": "Former Republican U.S. senator Ben Sasse of Nebraska was diagnosed with stage 4 metastatic pancreatic cancer in December and was told he had three or four months to live.\n\nHe credits \"providence, prayer and a miracle drug\" — a clinical trial that has shrunk his tumors by 76% —",
